  "title": "Infrastructure design codes | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website",
  "text": "Infrastructure design codes | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nTown Government\nDoing Business\nDiscover Castle Rock\nTown Topics\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nTown Government\nCode Central\nInfrastructure Design Codes\nInfrastructure design codes\nTechnical manuals and Public Works details\nThe technical design specifications contained in the technical manuals are adopted by reference in\nTitle 15 of the Municipal Code\nand include:\nTechnical manuals\nConstruction Methodology and Materials Manual (PDF)\nTESC Standard Notes and Details (PDF)\nTemporary Erosion and Sediment Control (TESC Manual) (PDF)\nLandscape and Irrigation Performance Standards and Criteria Manual (PDF)\nStorm Drainage Design and Technical Criteria Manual (PDF)\nNotice:\nrevisions made to referenced Urban Storm Drainage Criteria Manual published by the Mile High Flood District (PDF)\n.\nTransportation Design Criteria Manual (PDF)\nWater System Design Criteria Manual (PDF)\nWastewater Collection System Design Criteria Manual (PDF)\nPublic Works details and forms\nView\nPublic Works details and forms\n.\nIf you are unable to access any portion of these documents due to a disability as defined under\nColorado House Bill 21-1110\n, we are here to help! Please call us at 303-663-4440,\nemail the Town’s accessibility team\nor\nsubmit an accommodation request form\n.\nDevelopment Procedures Manual\nInfrastructure Design Codes\nLand Development Applications and Checklists\nMunicipal Code\nPermit Application\nPublic Works Details and Forms\nAccess Online Services\nApply for Jobs\nAttend an Event\nPay Water Bill\nTrack Roadwork\nView Development Activity\nContact Us\n100 N. Wilcox St.\nCastle Rock, CO 80104\nPhone:\n720-896-8696\nTown staff directory\nTown news sign up\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nNextdoor\nX\nYouTube\nHelpful Links\nAccess online services\nFact or Fiction?\nFrequently asked questions\nLocal business directory\nTown amenities\nAdmin login\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHome\nParks & Rec\nWater\nPolice\nFire\nPublic Works\nDevelopment\nAccessibility\nCopyright\nNondiscrimination\nPrivacy\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
